  "selected_configuration": "autorater-config/4 (openai/gpt-oss-20b @ 6cee5e81, prompt gate1-judge/2.0.0, parser gate1-parse/2.0.0, greedy, skip_special_tokens=false, reasoning_effort=high, cap 2048) for held-out calibration",
  "grounds": [
   "low reasoning (config/2) is dominated: systematic +-1 and saturation counting mislabels (235 development disagreements)",
   "medium (config/3) improves substantially over low (235 -> 69 disagreements)",
   "high (config/4) further reduces valid-label errors (69 -> 28 disagreements; per-item transitions wrong->correct 48 vs correct->wrong 11)",
