   "repeated greedy stability is perfect (0 label flips, 0 status changes) in all three rounds under fixed execution configuration",
   "all residual high-effort disagreements inspected are judge-side counting errors; the frozen verifier, its independent reimplementation, and a word-boundary regex agree 28/28",
   "no verifier defect has been identified in any round (mechanical agreement 235/235, 69/69, 28/28)",
   "additional compute cost (~2.2x tokens; 63 vs 30 minutes for the development phase) is acceptable at this study's scale"
  ],
  "verifier_changes": "none in any round; regression suite unchanged",
  "known_limitations": [
   "coverage 95.7% under high (vs 97.7% medium): truncation abstentions concentrate on dense high-n fail-class texts (largest single stratum regression: qwen3-4b n=8, 0 -> 5 conservative errors, all truncations) \u2014 the known trade-off, not a new failure mode",
   "residual disagreement direction is predominantly verifier-fail -> SATISFIES under-counting on near-miss items",
   "autorater evidence is a proxy evaluation only: never human validation, never ground truth"
  ]
